# Guinea worm infected millions a year. How many human cases were there in 2025?
subtitle: "Guinea worm infected millions a year in 1986. Guess how many cases were left in 2025, then see how it fell without a vaccine or a cure."
tags: ["health","epidemiology","history"]
format: quiz
thumb: "band \"No vaccine. No cure. Nearly gone.\" note \"How?\""

## Guinea worm infected millions a year. How many human cases were there in 2025?
use: line_chart
with:
    x:
      - 1989
      - 1991
      - 1993
      - 1995
      - 1997
