sources:
    - id: owid
      title: Reported cases of guinea worm disease
      authors: Our World in Data, from the World Health Organization (2026)
      year: 2026
      url: https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/number-of-reported-guinea-worm-dracunculiasis-cases
      finding: 'reported human cases worldwide: 892,055 in 1989, 75,223 in 2000, 22 in 2015, 15 in 2024, 10 in 2025'
    - id: carter
      title: 10 Guinea Worm Cases Reported Last Year, Lowest on Record
      authors: The Carter Center
      year: 2026
      url: https://www.cartercenter.org/stories/10-guinea-worm-cases-reported-last-year-lowest-on-record/
      finding: an estimated 3.5 million cases a year in 21 countries in 1986; 10 human cases in 2025; no vaccine or medicine; would be the first parasitic disease eradicated; the worm also infects animals, mostly dogs in Chad, which must also reach zero before eradication can be certified

    icon worm #8f6b4e size 300 set game-icons x 280 y 440 or ["worm"] icon_look picture of earth-worm hidden true
    text y86 "1986: 3.5 million" #b5482e cites ["carter"] x 700 y 520 font_size 58 hidden true
    icon water size 110 set twemoji x 600 y 400 icon_look picture of droplet hidden true
    text water_l "in the water" #2f6b8f x 780 y 400 font_size 46 hidden true
    text metre "up to 1 m long" #2f6b8f x 700 y 290 font_size 46 hidden true
    text est "1986 estimate: 3.5 m ↑" #5e584e cites ["carter"] x 470 y 560 font_size 40 hidden true
    dot p00 #5e584e at.data [2000,75223] hidden true
    text y00 "2000: 75,000" above-right p00 gap 40 #5e584e cites ["owid"] font_size 44 hidden true
    dot p15 #2f6b8f at.data [2015,22] hidden true
    text y15 "2015: 22" #2f6b8f cites ["owid"] x 310 y 235 font_size 46 hidden true
    dot p24 #2f6b8f at.data [2024,15] hidden true
    text y24 "Dec 2024: Carter dies" #2f6b8f cites ["owid"] x 700 y 530 font_size 38 hidden true
    dot p25 #b5482e at.data [2025,10] hidden true
    text y25 "2025: 10" #b5482e cites ["owid"] x 760 y 420 font_size 64 hidden true

    card title "Guinea worm: how many cases now?"

In 1986, guinea worm infected about three and a half million people a year. How many human cases were left in 2025?
    draw worm y86

People catch it from drinking water, by swallowing tiny fleas that carry its larvae.
    draw water water_l

A year later, a worm up to a metre long breaks out through the skin.
    draw metre

    erase water water_l metre y86 worm

    quiz "Tap your answer." on_canvas true reveal.text "10 cases" reveal.size 70
        right: About ten: ten human cases in the whole world, the lowest ever recorded.
        wrong: Think smaller: the campaign has run for forty years.
        + About 10
        * About 10,000
        * About a million

    erase reveal_1_stamp

Here are the reported cases since 1989: almost nine hundred thousand that year, fewer than the estimates, but the same story.
    draw axes line_1 est

By 2000, about seventy-five thousand.
    draw p00 y00

    erase p00 y00 est

Now zoom right in on the last ten years.
    animate xlim.0 2015 ylim.1 70 duration 2.5

Twenty-two cases in 2015. Ten in 2025.
    draw p15 y15 p25 y25

No vaccine, no medicine. Just cloth filters, clean water, and keeping people with a worm out of ponds.
    icon filt size 100 set twemoji x 240 y 580 icon_look picture of "potable water"
    text filt_l "cloth filters" #2f6b8f x 250 y 480 font_size 44

    erase filt filt_l

Jimmy Carter's foundation led the fight from 1986. He hoped to outlive the last worm, and died in December 2024.
    draw p24 y24

The catch: the worm also infects dogs, mostly in Chad, and they must reach zero too.
    icon dogs size 110 set twemoji x 240 y 580 icon_look picture of "dog face"
    text dogs_l "dogs, too (Chad)" #2f6b8f cites ["carter"] x 270 y 480 font_size 40

    erase dogs dogs_l

    erase y24

If they do, guinea worm will be only the second human disease ever wiped out, and the first without a vaccine or a cure.
    text sp "smallpox ✓" #5e584e x 720 y 630 font_size 52
    text gw "guinea worm ☐" #b5482e x 720 y 550 font_size 52

